  "prefLabel": "En 702.08 Sewage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 702.08 \"Sewage\" means ground garbage, human or animal excretions, and all other waterborne waste normally disposed of by residential, industrial, or commercial facilities through a sanitary sewage disposal system excluding solid waste, industrial waste, and septic pumping.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
